.net/6cd7d2e9/uploads/origins/1c01a258-550e-470b-af17-a3ba04b30fac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a32e88a8e9012cfa585db206624aa60 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6cd7d2e9/uploads/origins/1c01a258-550e-470b-af17-a3ba04b30fac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4848df5ee55634ea7b0854cf1afa12be 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Soumaru-sensei's work is very beautiful. I have a request.\n\nCould you please draw the character on the left in the reference image in the pose on the right with the bouquet? Please draw the whole body or from the thighs up. Clothing can be a cute sunny dress. The background should be a simple sky and flower petals.\n\nThank you very much!\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14--eVu1lJEbNUXOGcfCJM2y5gILnpU_f/view?usp=sharing\n----------\nこんにちは！爽丸先生の作品はとても美しいですね。お願いがあります。\n\n参考画像の左のキャラクターをブーケを持って右のポーズで描いていただけませんか？全身か太ももから上を描いてください。服装はかわいい晴れ着で構いません。背景はシンプルに空と花びらでお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14--eVu1lJEbNUXOGcfCJM2y5gILnpU_f/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_sawamaru_/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2874843, "client_id": 1274553, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/611efe75/uploads/origins/b0b22a4f-c9b1-42ef-b1a4-4e055bab903f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1e4046293e6d63344020b53574d453", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/611efe75/uploads/origins/b0b22a4f-c9b1-42ef-b1a4-4e055bab903f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1e4046293e6d63344020b53574d453, https://si.imgix.net/611efe75/uploads/origins/b0b22a4f-c9b1-42ef-b1a4-4e055bab903f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd535058fd84971ad90bd61dc9682a1c 2x, https://si.